    21,                       !- Day of Month
    SummerDesignDay,          !- Day Type
    31.2,                     !- Maximum DryBulb Temperature
    10.7,                     !- Daily DryBulb Temperature Range
    DefaultMultipliers,       !- DryBulb Temperature Range Modifier Type
